{"id":67468,"date":"2025-09-08T12:34:58","date_gmt":"2025-09-08T11:34:58","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=67468"},"modified":"2026-09-27T22:29:06","modified_gmt":"2026-09-27T21:29:06","slug":"trail-da-amizade","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-da-amizade\/","title":{"rendered":"Trail da Amizade 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Trail da Amizade 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Trail da Amizade 2026<\/strong> realiza-se nos dias <strong>5 e 6 de dezembro de 2026<\/strong> (S\u00e1bado e Domingo), em <strong>Ansi\u00e3o<\/strong> (distrito de Leiria). Organizada pela <strong>CAAS Events<\/strong> em estreita colabora\u00e7\u00e3o com as entidades locais e cronometragem oficial <strong>Stop&#038;Go<\/strong>, a prova convida a comunidade do trail running a desafiar os relevos c\u00e1rsicos, carvalhais e caminhos hist\u00f3ricos do Maci\u00e7o de Sic\u00f3.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">O vasto programa desportivo inclui o <strong>Ultra Trail (UTA 50 km)<\/strong>, <strong>Trail Longo (TLA 32 km)<\/strong>, <strong>Trail Curto (TCA 19 km)<\/strong>, <strong>Mini Trail (MTA 12 km)<\/strong>, <strong>Caminhada (CMA 10 km)<\/strong>, a prova combinada <strong>TCE (50 km + 32 km)<\/strong> e o <strong>Trail Kids<\/strong>. As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es abrem na 1\u00aa fase a partir de 12,00 \u20ac (com op\u00e7\u00e3o de almo\u00e7o quente a 3,00 \u20ac), garantindo dorsal, brindes, abastecimentos rigorosos, medalha de finalista e banhos quentes no pavilh\u00e3o.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">05 a 06 de Dezembro de 2026<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: 