nt-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">CMA &#8211; Caminhada da Amizade<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 2026-12-06 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:45<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 12,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (05\/10\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 15,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (02\/11\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">3\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 17,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (29\/11\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Jovem<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Trail Kids<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 2026-12-05 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 15:00<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase \u00danica:<\/strong> 5,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (29\/11\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o Trail da Amizade 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova realiza-se nos dias <strong>5 e 6 de dezembro de 2026<\/strong>, no concelho de Ansi\u00e3o (distrito de Leiria), com centro log\u00edstico no Pavilh\u00e3o Municipal de Ansi\u00e3o.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias dispon\u00edveis no evento?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O programa integra o Ultra Trail de 50 km, Trail Longo de 32 km, Trail Curto de 19 km, Mini Trail de 12 km, Caminhada de 10 km, o desafio combinado TCE (50 km + 32 km) e o Trail Kids.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o tipo de terreno e caracter\u00edsticas do percurso em Ansi\u00e3o?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Os percursos atravessam a t\u00edpica paisagem c\u00e1rsica da Serra do Sic\u00f3, com caminhos calc\u00e1rios, trilhos t\u00e9cnicos por entre carvalhais, passagens rurais e vistas panor\u00e2micas sobre os vales da regi\u00e3o.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais os valores de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e prazos oficiais?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Na 1\u00aa fase (at\u00e9 5 de outubro), os valores s\u00e3o: 25\u20ac (50 km), 14\u20ac (32 km), 13\u20ac (19 km), 12,50\u20ac (12 km), 12\u20ac (Caminhada) e 5\u20ac (Kids). As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es s\u00e3o efetuadas online na Stop&#038;Go.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Existe op\u00e7\u00e3o de refei\u00e7\u00e3o\/almo\u00e7o p\u00f3s-prova?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim, os atletas podem adquirir como extra uma refei\u00e7\u00e3o quente de almo\u00e7o conv\u00edvio (menu normal ou op\u00e7\u00e3o vegan) pelo valor de apenas 3,00 \u20ac por participante.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O que inclui o kit de participante do atleta?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Inclui dorsal oficial com chip de cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica, seguro de acidentes pessoais, abastecimentos ao longo dos trilhos e na meta, medalha de finalista alusiva e duches nos balne\u00e1rios municipais.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Trail da Amizade 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-12-05\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Ansi\u00e3o, Leiria\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Ansi\u00e3o\", \"addressRegion\": \"Leiria\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza o Trail da Amizade 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A prova realiza-se nos dias5 e 6 de dezembro de 2026, no concelho de Ansi\u00e3o (distrito de Leiria), com centro log\u00edstico no Pavilh\u00e3o Municipal de Ansi\u00e3o.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias dispon\u00edveis no evento?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O programa integra o Ultra Trail de 50 km, Trail Longo de 32 km, Trail Curto de 19 km, Mini Trail de 12 km, Caminhada de 10 km, o desafio combinado TCE (50 km + 32 km) e o Trail Kids.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 o tipo de terreno e caracter\u00edsticas do percurso em Ansi\u00e3o?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Os percursos atravessam a t\u00edpica paisagem c\u00e1rsica da Serra do Sic\u00f3, com caminhos calc\u00e1rios, trilhos t\u00e9cnicos por entre carvalhais, passagens rurais e vistas panor\u00e2micas sobre os vales da regi\u00e3o.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais os valores de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e prazos oficiais?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Na 1\u00aa fase (at\u00e9 5 de outubro), os valores s\u00e3o: 25\u20ac (50 km), 14\u20ac (32 km), 13\u20ac (19 km), 12,50\u20ac (12 km), 12\u20ac (Caminhada) e 5\u20ac (Kids). As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es s\u00e3o efetuadas online na Stop&Go.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Existe op\u00e7\u00e3o de refei\u00e7\u00e3o\/almo\u00e7o p\u00f3s-prova?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Sim, os atletas podem adquirir como extra uma refei\u00e7\u00e3o quente de almo\u00e7o conv\u00edvio (menu normal ou op\u00e7\u00e3o vegan) pelo valor de apenas 3,00 \u20ac por participante.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"O que inclui o kit de participante do atleta?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Inclui dorsal oficial com chip de cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica, seguro de acidentes pessoais, abastecimentos ao longo dos trilhos e na meta, medalha de finalista alusiva e duches nos balne\u00e1rios municipais.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"feature